  "result": "Perfect! I've successfully implemented the voucher system. Here's what was added:\n\n**Updated `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` function that:\n  - Applies a fixed amount voucher to draft invoices only (NOT_DRAFT error otherwise)\n  - Prevents multiple vouchers per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error)\n  - Validates amount is a positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n  - Returns the modified invoice with `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n\n- Updated `invoiceTotals()` to:\n  - Calculate voucher amount (0 if no voucher)\n  - Return new calculation: `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n  - Include `voucher` field in the returned totals object\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`:**\n- Added `VOUCHER_EXISTS` error code\n\n**Added 14 comprehensive tests in `test/invoices.test.js`:**\n- Voucher application to draft invoices\n- Voucher impact on totals\n- Validation: zero, negative, and fractional amounts\n- Non-draft invoice rejection\n- Multiple voucher prevention\n- Invoice mutation protection\n- Integration with existing discount and VAT calculations\n\nAll 195 tests pass. The voucher system correctly applies a fixed discount after VAT, exactly as required.",
